published while the research is still running. It is open in the sense that matters
at this stage: what it claims can be read, checked, and cited.

Reading, quoting, and citing are permitted without asking. A citation names this
directory, the revision it was read at, and the holder above.

Adoption is deferred. Copying all or part of it into another work, redistributing
it, modifying it for use elsewhere, and shipping a product that contains it require
prior written permission. The work is in progress, its interfaces still move, and a
copy taken now would carry a claim this directory no longer makes.

A request for that permission states what will be copied, where it will be placed,
and how the copy will carry this notice and the revision it was taken from, so the
provenance of a copy is evidenced rather than asserted.

